  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NAM 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oragererigwe omochie oyio omong’ainereria naende ogoita, oichire obotenenku boraibwe na gosakorwa!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tegerera ogwateka kw’emecharichi, okorasa kw’amagaari, ogocharara gw’echibarasi, na okonyenya gw’echigari chi’echibarasi chi’esegi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abariini be chibarasi nigo bagosiaroka, emioro ekobara amatimo akomeka meka!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebitondo bibangire amo gochia igoro, emebere ekwete etari na mobaro abasacha bakogochwa nero!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninawi omotomani nkoegwa are egesusuro. Akomeka meka na oichire n’ogwechabera kw’oborogi bw’ogoita, nigo aegete ebisaku na kobakora abasomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene Nyasae nigo agoteeba, Ninyee Ninawi egesusuro! Ngochobore otigare getirianda erio ngotigere ebisaku bikorore, birore obosoku bwao bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikobogorie ase ogochaaya naende ngotube ne eubi. Abanto mbakorigererie n’omondoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onde bwensi orakorigererie natame gochia magega. Barobwo mbateebe, ’Ninawi yatigaire koba ritombe! Ing’o ore n’amabeebe ande onsi ase are? Ning’o oraganie komoremia?’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Ninawi, Nigo ore gai kobwa Tebesi, omochie omonene o Misiri? Oyio boigo narenge n’oroche rokomokengera ronga enyasi Naeli nero yarenge egekengero kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere nigo agamberete Etiopia na Misiri boigo, chinguru chiaye tichiarenge n’echimbebe; Libia nere orenge omosani oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Tebesi bakabogorigwa gochia gooswa. Ase kera ensinyo y’agachie abana babo bagaitwa goika bagakwa. Abatang’ani babo bakabogorigwa babekire ebinyuri na kogabanwa ase abasakori babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninawi, aye boigo nogwe gochia ase ogosundoka kw’ogotindu! Aye boigo norigie gotama korwa ase ababisa bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiburi chiao chionsi nigo chirabe buna emeko ere namako atobire: nyegeria emete, n’amatunda akogwere gocha ase omonwa oo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwani bao nigo banga abakungu, n’ense yao yatenenire etabwati abarendi ase obosio bw’ababisa bao. Omorero nosarie emekorogoto y’ebiita biao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gachie roche bweariganie ase okoboerwa, boigo kong’ia chindwaki chiao! Tiringa esike oroisie amatabori, naende obeke ang’e esike y’amatabori!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye n’okora ekio orakore, goika osambwe okwe gose oitwe ase esegi. Aye nosirigwe buna endagera ekoriegwa n’echingige. Aye nigo gwaichorete buna chingige!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo kwaiborete abaonchoreria abange kobwa ching’enang’eni chire ase erioba! Korende bono bachiire, buna chingige chikorambora chimbaba chiabo chiairuruka chiagenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanene bao nigo banga buna risaga ri’echingige echio chigotigara ase chinyasi ase rituko ri’obokendu. Korende ekero risase rigosoka, chirochio chiairuruka, na onde taiyo okomanya ase chikogenda!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omorwoti bw’Abaasuri; abagabana bao bakuure, n’abanene bao nigo baraire kare na kare! Abanto bao basiarerwe ase ebitunwa igoro, na onde taiyo orabairanie gocha inka naende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NAM 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riogo tiriyo gose, amaote ao takonyara kobwena. Bonsi abakoigwa amang’ana ao y’ogosarigwa nigo bagwaka chinkobi n’omogoko. Nareo onde bwensi otambogete obotindi bwao botakoera?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
